 301:Toeplitz_FFT.c ****     // allocation here. static so these live in .bss, not on the stack --
 302:Toeplitz_FFT.c ****     // at large ROWLEN (e.g. 1024 bytes = 8192 bits) two ROWBITS-sized
 303:Toeplitz_FFT.c ****     // float complex arrays (8 bytes each) don't come close to fitting in
